"""The GCAM family: one beginner-friendly deck per component model (Hector, Xanthos, Tethys, Demeter, moirai, the land
module, the economy, gcamdata), each with a step animation and a 3D scene (assets/js/family3d.js).
Facts follow the models' own documentation and papers (listed on each deck's last slide); versions change, so check the
version you use. Rendered to gcam-family.html by build.py."""

